# {{appName}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add to your `Cargo.toml`:

```toml
[dependencies]
{{packageName}} = "{{packageVersion}}"
```

## Quick Start

```rust
use {{packageName}}::{{clientClassName}};

let client = {{clientClassName}}::with_token("https://api.example.com", "your-token", None);
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `Authenticator` trait implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```rust
use {{packageName}}::auth::bearer_authenticator::BearerAuthenticator;
use {{packageName}}::{{clientClassName}};

let authenticator = BearerAuthenticator::new("https://api.example.com", "your-token");
let client = {{clientClassName}}::new(Box::new(authenticator), None);
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
### Basic Auth

```rust
use {{packageName}}::auth::basic_authenticator::BasicAuthenticator;

let authenticator = BasicAuthenticator::new("https://api.example.com", "username", "password");
let client = {{clientClassName}}::new(Box::new(authenticator), None);
```

